ninfer-kvmem
Maintained by qzshch: https://github.com/qzshch/ninfer-kvmem

This distribution contains NInfer-derived code and local modifications for
KVMem working sets, Native prefix reuse, concurrency, speculative/vision
integration, instruction retention, lifecycle fixes, telemetry and modular
backend integration. Git history records individual upstream and local changes.
File-level distribution modification notices do not replace upstream authorship.

